This code implements a basic fast templating language with tokenization, caching, and lazy evaluation. The `Tokenizer` class tokenizes the input string into individual tokens, the `Cache` class stores the results of expensive operations, and the `LazyEvaluation` class evaluates the result only when needed. The `Template` class renders the template using the `Tokenizer` and `LazyEvaluation` classes. The `Cache` decorator caches the results of expensive operations to optimize performance.

